00:32:46.331 --> 00:32:48.099 align:start size:88% position:13%
The guy, he has
written about 30 books,

00:32:48.099 --> 00:32:50.301
which is three times
more than I've written.

00:32:53.204 --> 00:32:56.607 align:start size:97% position:3%
