00:33:22.834 --> 00:33:25.403
or a liberal Jew and
a liberal Christian.

00:33:25.403 --> 00:33:29.040 align:start size:97% position:3%
The divergence today is right,
left, not Christian, Jew.

00:33:29.040 --> 00:33:30.541
- Yeah.

00:33:30.541 --> 00:33:32.377
And that divergence doesn't
