00:37:51.168 --> 00:37:53.004
Very few people.

00:37:53.004 --> 00:37:57.275 align:start size:97% position:3%
But among them, overwhelmingly
they were religious people.

00:37:57.275 --> 00:38:00.878 align:start size:84% position:16%
Most religious people
failed the test.

00:38:00.878 --> 00:38:04.115
But of those who passed the
test, most were religious.

00:38:05.316 --> 00:38:08.886
- That's basically
as high of credit

00:38:08.886 --> 00:38:10.755
as you can give to
religion, I suppose.

00:38:10.755 --> 00:38:12.857
When the chips fall.

00:38:12.857 --> 00:38:15.526
- Not every religious
person is terrific,

00:38:15.526 --> 00:38:18.195 align:start size:84% position:16%
but most terrific
people are religious.

00:38:18.195 --> 00:38:22.900 align:start size:97% position:3%
- Chapter 34, I thought
this was really interesting

00:38:22.900 --> 00:38:24.168
in light of politics

00:38:24.168 --> 00:38:25.770
and something we kind
