00:38:39.383 --> 00:38:40.851
I would say not all.

00:38:40.851 --> 00:38:42.553
I would say we have an
exception here in Florida

00:38:42.553 --> 00:38:45.222 align:start size:97% position:3%
of a guy that's trying to just
do the good job that he's-

00:38:45.222 --> 00:38:47.692 align:start size:94% position:6%
- That's right. He doesn't
