00:38:47.692 --> 00:38:48.659
- But most of them-

00:38:48.659 --> 00:38:50.227
- So let me...

00:38:50.227 --> 00:38:52.063
I'm so happy you picked on that.

00:38:52.963 --> 00:38:56.300
The single Greatest crisis

00:38:56.300 --> 00:39:00.905 align:start position:0%
