00:39:16.454 --> 00:39:18.889
The moment a parent
wants to be loved,

00:39:18.889 --> 00:39:21.826
that is the end of
their parenting.

00:39:21.826 --> 00:39:24.729 align:start size:94% position:6%
The moment a political
leader wishes to be loved,

00:39:24.729 --> 00:39:28.165 align:start position:0%
that is the end of their
validity as a political leader.

00:39:28.165 --> 00:39:30.434 align:start size:84% position:16%
The moment the teacher
wants to be loved,

00:39:30.434 --> 00:39:32.770 align:start size:88% position:13%
that is the end of
their teaching ability.

00:39:32.770 --> 00:39:35.906 align:start size:94% position:6%
The only people we should
want to be loved from

00:39:35.906 --> 00:39:39.977 align:start size:84% position:16%
are our spouses and
friends, end of issue.

00:39:41.412 --> 00:39:43.748 align:start size:94% position:6%
- Well, I know somebody
is watching this thinking,

00:39:43.748 --> 00:39:45.249
but wait a minute, Dennis,

