00:40:41.071 --> 00:40:43.240
of doing what he does for love.

00:40:43.240 --> 00:40:45.876
- I got it. I got it.

00:40:45.876 --> 00:40:48.946 align:start size:88% position:13%
But love comes along the
way when you do this.

00:40:48.946 --> 00:40:51.081
Isn't that something?
Isn't that something?

00:40:51.081 --> 00:40:53.684 align:start size:97% position:3%
When you do something that's
good and honest and true,

00:40:53.684 --> 00:40:54.952
you get a lot of love.

00:40:54.952 --> 00:40:56.787
I mean, I've been out
and about with you.

00:40:56.787 --> 00:40:57.755
- Well, that is right.

00:40:57.755 --> 00:40:59.356
That's the irony, isn't it?

00:40:59.356 --> 00:41:03.994
If you act noble and
not in pursuit of love,

00:41:03.994 --> 00:41:05.763 align:start size:84% position:16%
you will end up
with a lot of love.

00:41:06.931 --> 00:41:10.034
So, you know, one of
